      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To Turn In",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "f8d251e6-5646-4d97-b5b9-d3e4fd8d2f7f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n👉 The GitHub issue being closed will be considered your submission! ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To officially turn it in, please comment on the issue and then close it.\n",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🙏 In your comment please include:What you learnedWhat went well & what didn’t \n\nInclude hosted URLs or screenshots you want us to view. README.md file included in repo per aboveat least 2 commits per person with ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.github.com/articles/why-are-my-commits-linked-to-the-wrong-user/#commits-are-not-linked-to-any-user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "author recognized by github",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". \n\nIMPORTANT! Please make sure GitHub recognizes your commit author email.\n",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
